":0.0874,"r20_spy":0.1688}},{"id":"DT 2027 Q2","t":"DT","d":"2026-11-03","time":"bmo","w":9028,"n":62,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/dynatrace-dt-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,1,0,1.12],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[1,1,0,1.12,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}]},"move":{"r1":-0.1469,"r5":-0.2024,"r1_spy":-0.1499,"r5_spy":-0.2032}}],"quotes":[{"c":"DT 2020 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"First of all, we incurred onetime fees of approximately $14.9 million primarily related to the IPO and mainframe spend, as well as the minimal restructuring that hit the P&L in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2020 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"I'll start by providing a more detailed review of our second quarter performance, and then I will finish with our outlook for the third quarter and increased full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2020 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"And I will finish with our outlook for the fourth quarter and our increased full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2020 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"In summary, we are very pleased with our third-quarter performance, and our optimism about the future is reflected in our increased guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2020 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2020-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"I should point out for those who are new to our story, our full-stack APM module includes both infrastructure monitoring and AI ops, fully unified.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2020 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2020-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"When we talk about APM platform, we're including infrastructure monitoring, we're including AI ops.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2020-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"For our many Kubernetes customers, we announced extended AI-powered support for advanced observability of Kubernetes infrastructure, container and application workloads.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"We are very pleased with our margin performance, primarily due to the efficient way we manage our platform, coupled with modest cost savings related to the macro shutdown.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"Based on the strength of our Q1 results and the ability to grow through the difficult economic backdrop, we have increased our annual guidance for revenue and profitability, as Kevin will discuss in a few minutes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"There are three areas that I'd like to highlight this morning that give us confidence in our ability to achieve our increased guidance for fiscal 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"With respect to margins, we continue to see an expansion in our gross margins as the subscription revenue mix increases, combined with the way we manage our platform, as well as some cost savings related to the macro environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2020-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"Today, I plan to review our strong Q2 results, and then I will review our increased full-year guidance and our outlook for the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2020-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"As a result, we are raising guidance for fiscal '21.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"This margin level is above our previous annual guidance of 29% to 30% due to a combination of the health of the top line, COVID-related cost savings, and a tax refund that was more favorable than our original estimates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"That's 2 percentage points above the high end of our previous guidance due to the top line strength of the business combined with COVID-related cost savings as well as a favorable tax refund of approximately $10 million versus our original guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2021-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"Based on the strength of our Q3 results, we are raising our guidance across the board for fiscal 2021, which Kevin will provide more details on shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"We saw an expansion in our gross margin driven by cost savings related to the pandemic, combined with the benefits of our efficient Dynatrace platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2021 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"So as I'm sure you can see, over the course of fiscal '21, earlier in the year, we had quite a big cost savings on the P&L that sort of flowed through to op income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2022 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2021-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"With the strength of our Q1 results and positive outlook ahead, we are increasing our guidance for fiscal 2022, which Kevin will provide more details on shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2022 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2021-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Van Siclen","x":"With the strength of our Q2 results and positive outlook ahead, we are increasing our guidance for fiscal 2022, which Kevin will provide more detail on shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/dynatrace-inc-dt-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2022 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2022-02-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"Second, Q3 was a very strong quarter, beating expectations across all key operating metrics, and we are raising guidance for FY '22.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2022 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2022-02-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"With the strength of our Q3 results and positive outlook ahead we are increasing our guidance for FY '22, as I mentioned, which Kevin will provide more detail on shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/dynatrace-holdings-llc-dt-q3-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"DT 2022 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2022-05-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"We do have built-in price increases in our typical support contracts at time of renewal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/dynatrace-inc-dt-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2023 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Cikos","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/dynatrace-inc-dt-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2023 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2022-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"With respect to pricing and what's happening there from an end user standpoint, when we do renewals with our customers, we are actually looking to drive higher price increases, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/02/dynatrace-inc-dt-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2023 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2022-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Burns","x":"So historically, we've done sort of low single-digit price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/02/dynatrace-inc-dt-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2023 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2023-02-01","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Pinjalim Bora","x":"I want to ask you about just the performance across the different theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/01/dynatrace-dt-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2023 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2023-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"Organizations need answers and intelligent automation from data to streamline their processes and maximize employee productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/01/dynatrace-dt-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2023-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"And they are seeking a fully unified observability platform to help drive material cost savings and improved oversight by consolidating the myriad of disconnected tools they're using today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/dynatrace-dt-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2023-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"Well, it's a great question, and I would say that, in fairness, that there's -- we maintain the guide for the year because, one, as we had shared, that we thought that the seasonality would be a little bit more back-end loaded this year than normal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/dynatrace-dt-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2023-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"And if you do -- if you look at the guide, obviously, we're maintaining the guide to kind of low to mid-single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/dynatrace-dt-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2023-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"And as more organizations deploy generative AI, it isn't just to think about Davis CoPilot, it is also to think about all the workloads that companies are going to be deploying in generative AI that will dramatically increase compute and, therefore, the need to provide observability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/02/dynatrace-dt-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2023-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"We believe development teams will continue to take on a larger role in the observability and security decision process, and we are developing tools to streamline their product development lifecycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/02/dynatrace-dt-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2023-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"Moving on to guidance, we are raising our full year guidance across all top line and profitability metrics to reflect the strength of our second quarter performance, the health of our pipeline, and our visibility into the back half of the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/02/dynatrace-dt-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2024 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2024-05-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"Andy Jassy from Amazon stated that 85% or more of the global IT spend remains on-premises, and this is before we contemplate gen AI impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/15/dynatrace-dt-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2024-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"It's also we want to make sure we're landing them at the right size.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/dynatrace-dt-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2024-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"We are, however, maintaining our full year guidance for free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/dynatrace-dt-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2024-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"We've just -- for simplicity, we said we're not going to increase the guidance this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/dynatrace-dt-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2024-11-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"Last month, thousands tuned in to watch our Power of Possible streaming event, which featured several locations around the world and included customers and partners like BT and DXC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/dynatrace-dt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2024-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jim Benson","x":"Relative to maintaining the guide, I really would position it much more, as I outlined, as just being prudent, these changes that we made, while there's been no disruption, we do have a lot of reps with new accounts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/dynatrace-dt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2024-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jim Benson","x":"The maintaining guidance is just more a function of we want to allow the sales changes we've made to continue to season a bit less we get ahead of ourselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/dynatrace-dt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2025 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2025-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"I'd say, yeah, we are a bit light on new logo from a unit perspective, but I continue to remind you that we're very focused on the quality of the land, which is landing them at the right size.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/30/dynatrace-dt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2026 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2026-02-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"The durability of infrastructure software comes from deeply engineered data planes and AI control planes that operate in highly dynamic production environments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/dynatrace-dt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2026 Q3","e":"dt","d":"2026-02-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Benson","x":"As a result, we are raising full-year guidance across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/dynatrace-dt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2026 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2026-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"To close, observability is already mission-critical infrastructure for AI-driven enterprises.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/dynatrace-dt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2026 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2026-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Hedberg","x":"And I guess I'm just wondering, like, is there a lag between enterprise AI and inferencing spend and ultimately, your observability products?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/dynatrace-dt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2026 Q4","e":"dt","d":"2026-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Benson","x":"In our GAAP results, please note that our Q4 GAAP operating income includes $28 million in restructuring and impairment charges, primarily reflecting actions to align our cost structure with our strategic growth and scale priorities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/dynatrace-dt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2027 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"AI agents are taking autonomous action across infrastructure and enterprise customers are now deploying AI rapidly, not because every risk has been resolved, but because standing still means falling behind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/dynatrace-dt-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2027 Q1","e":"dt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Benson","x":"We have updated our free cash flow definition to adjusted free cash flow, which excludes the impact of restructuring, acquisition-related and other nonrecurring cash expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/dynatrace-dt-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2027 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick McConnell","x":"You mentioned AI, and I would just say that for AI natives, the infrastructure monitoring approach is, in all likelihood, the simplest onboarding.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/dynatrace-dt-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DT 2027 Q2","e":"dt","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Benson","x":"We do not want to get ahead of ourselves, but I do not want you to think that not raising the guide does not mean we do not have conviction in delivering to the guidance that we just outlined.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/dynatrace-dt-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[39,1,8155,0,0,0,6942,847],[40,1,10087,0,0,0,8725,945],[41,1,8861,0,0,0,7448,1134],[42,1,8863,0,0,0,7213,1352],[43,1,8504,0,0,0,6794,1389],[44,1,8951,0,0,0,6988,1627],[45,1,9314,0,0,0,7515,1398],[46,1,9545,0,0,0,7677,1464],[47,1,8809,0,0,0,7022,1377],[48,1,10048,0,0,0,7975,1623],[49,